    "properties": {},
    "text": "Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 needs a speech runtime, the software that runs the model on this computer. Downloading the model alone does not enable transcription.\n\nThis computer's NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 can run it:\n\n\u2022 Use this GPU: NVIDIA Speech GPU runs the model on the RTX\u00a02060 with CUDA, usually several times faster than the CPU. 106\u00a0MB download, 432\u00a0MB on disk.\n\n\u2022 Use the CPU: NVIDIA Speech CPU runs it on the processor. 5\u00a0MB download, 26\u00a0MB on disk.\n\nYou can add the other runtime later in Downloads. The model loads automatically once it and the runtime are both downloaded.\n\nThis installs third-party executable software. Archive integrity checks do not guarantee security. Keep speech runtimes updated. See the runtime's source and license in Downloads.\n\nIf you choose Later, the model stays unavailable until you install a runtime in Downloads.",
